/// M09 CORE-031 "bundled native declarations: build-accept plus six rejections".
/// Source: tests/integration/native_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledNativeDeclarations (L15-87).
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/native/declarations.can (read
/// at L63, staged pristine as src/main.can at L67) with the 8 native raw
/// fixtures staged at L68 via stageRawFixtures (raw_fixtures_test.go L16-36:
/// every native/fixtures/*.json lands under src/fixtures/).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the pristine declarations fixture builds green and
/// each of the six changed declarations rejects: dynamic question
/// descriptor (L74), unknown model field (L75), wrong result type (L76),
/// missing exported member (L77), dynamic ask (L78), bytes-for-string
/// (L79). Every mutation pins its from/to pair verbatim plus its reject
/// leg (L81-85: status 0 or empty diagnostics fatals "invalid native
/// declaration accepted").
/// ADAPTATIONS (recorded, with source lines): asks "Choose" appears twice
/// in the fixture (L44 and L56) but Go rewrites the first occurrence only
/// (L78: Replace with n=1), so mut-ask-from pins the single rewritten site.
/// str message appears twice (fixture L33 and L70) and Go rewrites all
/// occurrences (L79: Replace with n=-1), so mut-bytes-type-count pins 2.
/// The mutation targets (question(first), unknown "jev-latest", ok 1, the
/// shortened provides list, asks call describe(certainty), uses [bytes, ai,
/// bytes::buffer message) are absent from the pristine fixture by
/// construction (byte-verified count 0). The fixture connection line holds
/// a harness-managed secret placeholder that transcript tooling
/// display-masks; no pin copies that line (byte-truth rule), and every
/// pin below was verified at byte level with grep -c/md5 before writing.
/// Facet map (native_test.go legs): build-accept pins the green baseline
/// (L69-72); bad-count pins the six mutations (L73-80); mut-question-from
/// pins question("Second") (fixture L38; the question("First") call at L37
/// is untouched); mut-question-to pins question(first) (L74);
/// mut-question-reject pins its rejection; mut-field-from pins model
/// "jev-latest" (fixture L11; the fixture-model metadata at L18 is
/// untouched); mut-field-to pins unknown "jev-latest" (L75);
/// mut-field-reject pins its rejection; mut-type-from pins ok false
/// (fixture L28); mut-type-to pins ok 1 (L76); mut-type-reject pins its
/// rejection; mut-member-from pins provides [weights, weighted, classifier]
/// (fixture L2); mut-member-to pins provides [weights, weighted] (L77);
/// mut-member-reject pins its rejection; mut-ask-from pins asks "Choose"
/// (L78; first of the fixture L44/L56 sites); mut-ask-to pins asks call
/// describe(certainty) (L78); mut-ask-reject pins its rejection;
/// mut-bytes-uses-from pins uses [ai, (fixture L3); mut-bytes-uses-to pins
/// uses [bytes, ai, (L79); mut-bytes-type-from pins str message (L79);
/// mut-bytes-type-to pins bytes::buffer message (L79); mut-bytes-type-count
/// pins the 2 rewritten sites (fixture L33/L70); mut-bytes-reject pins its
/// rejection; fixture-source pins the read path (L63); raw-fixture-count
/// pins the 8 staged raw fixtures (L68); raw-fixture-dir pins src/fixtures
/// (raw_fixtures_test.go L35); raw-assess/raw-generate/raw-retrieve pin the
/// three using-raw references (fixture L36/L73/L80).
/// The roots-green pin lives in core-031-roots-green.can; the production
/// process shape lives in core-031-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: valid declarations (default) plus the six compiler-rejection
/// mutations (each pinned as from/to/reject; no live run now).
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/WORK/PROC/N1
/// and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now. Descriptor
/// timeout 120000ms mirrors the Go 2-minute ctx (L22).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23 unmet).
/// Case native/declarations checks: build-accept, bad-count,
/// mut-question-from, mut-question-to, mut-question-reject, mut-field-from,
/// mut-field-to, mut-field-reject, mut-type-from, mut-type-to,
/// mut-type-reject, mut-member-from, mut-member-to, mut-member-reject,
/// mut-ask-from, mut-ask-to, mut-ask-reject, mut-bytes-uses-from,
/// mut-bytes-uses-to, mut-bytes-type-from, mut-bytes-type-to,
/// mut-bytes-type-count, mut-bytes-reject, fixture-source,
/// raw-fixture-count, raw-fixture-dir, raw-assess, raw-generate,
/// raw-retrieve.
